BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 231.25 Tm (relatives should each carry a source, observed date, and confidence reason. Two vendors selling the same underlying) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 216.02 Tm (telephone feed are one evidentiary lineage, not two independent confirmations. A shared surname and nearby address) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 200.80 Tm (are weak support for a recycled mobile number; a consistent historical address chain plus a separate current public) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 185.57 Tm (filing is stronger. Rank contacts by recency and agreement, set aside contradictory records, and record wrong-party) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 170.35 Tm (responses promptly. For relatives, use a limited locating inquiry without disclosing the surplus amount or sensitive) Tj ET
